{
  "info": {
    "name": "Morsh CRM \u2014 Multi-Tenant",
    "description": "Multi-tenant CRM API.\n\n## How to use\n1. Set `baseUrl` in the environment (default `http://localhost:5000`).\n2. Run **Auth \u2192 Login (Acme ADMIN)** and **Login (Globex ADMIN)** \u2014 both store their tokens in collection variables automatically.\n3. Run **Leads \u2192 List leads** once; it captures an Acme lead id into `acmeLeadId`.\n4. Run the whole **\ud83d\udd12 Security \u2014 cross-tenant** folder. Every request there is expected to FAIL (404 or 403) and has a test asserting exactly that.\n\nThe security folder reproduces section 14 of the assessment brief.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
